    "Other source diagrams and publisher marks retain unknown full graphical cost. Extracted labels remain literal; this audit is not an OCR reconstruction.",
    "Both source front/back matter and all own reference pages remain included. The new code appendix includes the visible line-wrap hook; its literal extracted comma remains a documented representation limitation.",
    "All two reader pages fit and have readable table/qualification text; no missing glyph or clipping observed."
